      *                 ADDED ABILITY TO REPROCESS HISTORICAL SUPERS (IE.
      *                 "PRIOR SUPE", WHERE SUPER IS ALREADY IN DATABASE)
      * --------------------------------------------------------------------
      * 03/30/03 BY:   PENNY GENOVESE
      *          DESC: MOVED "ALLOCATE" STATEMENTS (2) TO BEGINNING OF
      *                PROCEDURE DIVISION. (ABEND STILL OCCURRING.)
      * --------------------------------------------------------------------
      * 03/28/03 BY:   LITA MIRANDA
      *          DESC: MOVED "ALLOCATE" STATEMENT OUTSIDE OF LOOP TO
      *                PREVENT ABENDS.
      * --------------------------------------------------------------------
      * 10/21/02 BY:   GAIL WALDER
