      ***************************************************************
      * R2300-DELETE-OLD-PART                                       *
      *     1. DELETE OLD PART ROW                                  *
      ***************************************************************
       R2300-DELETE-OLD-PART.
           MOVE "R2300-DELETE-OLD-PART" TO WS-PARAGRAPH.
           MOVE WS-PARAGRAPH TO WS-PARNAME.
           MOVE "PART" TO WS-TBLNAME.
           MOVE "DELETE " TO WS-FUNCTION.

