      * E.G.  TRANS: A -> C      DB: A -> B -> C                        

           IF SUPERSEDING-PART-NUMBER OF SUPERSESSION
              EQUAL TR-NEW-PART-NUM            
              MOVE "Y" TO WS-TRANS-ERR-SW                                
              MOVE WS-ERR-MSG-TR9 TO WS-ERR-MSG
              GO TO C1000-EXIT.                                          
                                                                        
      * IF CHAIN ENDS WITH TRANS OLD PART NUMBER                        
      * E.G.  TRANS: A -> Z      DB: A -> B -> C -> A                   
           IF SUPERSEDING-PART-NUMBER OF SUPERSESSION
              EQUAL TR-OLD-PART-NUM            
              MOVE WS-ERR-MSG-TR15 TO WS-ERR-MSG 
              GO TO C1000-EXIT.                                          
                                                                         
      * CHAIN ENDS WITH DIFFERENT PART; THEREFORE "ALREADY SUPE"        
      * E.G.  TRANS: A -> Z      DB: A -> B -> C 
           MOVE "Y" TO WS-TRANS-ERR-SW.                                 
           MOVE WS-ERR-MSG-TR11 TO WS-ERR-MSG.                          
                                                                        
       C1000-EXIT. EXIT.                                                
